"Many S3-compatible providers disable ACLs or do not implement the ACL APIs. "
"In that case, the provider error is returned as an `s3_error`."
msgstr "许多 S3 兼容服务提供商会禁用 ACL，或未实现 ACL API。在这种情况下，服务提供商"
"错误会以 `s3_error` 返回。"

