msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:346"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:363
msgid "presign_read"
msgstr "presign_read"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:365
msgid "Unreleased - Introduced."
msgstr "尚未发布 - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:367
msgid "Canonical API name: `ptool.s3.Connection:presign_read`."
msgstr "规范 API 名称：`ptool.s3.Connection:presign_read`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:369
msgid ""
"`conn:presign_read(path[, options])` returns a presigned GET URL for "
"downloading an object without sharing credentials."
msgstr "`conn:presign_read(path[, options])` 返回一个预签名 GET URL，用于在不共享凭证的情况下下载对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:371
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:371"
msgid "`path` (string, required): The object path."
msgstr "`path`（string，必填）：对象路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:372
msgid "`options` (table, optional): Presigning options."
msgstr "`options`（table，选填）：预签名选项。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:373
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:373"
msgid "Returns: `string`."
msgstr "返回：`string`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:375
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:375"
msgid "`options` fields:"
msgstr "`options` 字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:377
msgid ""
"`expires_in` (integer, optional): Validity in seconds, from 1 to 604800 "
"(seven days). Defaults to 3600."
msgstr "`expires_in`（integer，选填）：有效期，单位为秒，范围为 1 到 604800（七天）。默认值为 3600。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:378
msgid ""
"`response_content_type` (string, optional): Overrides the download "
"response's Content-Type."
msgstr "`response_content_type`（string，选填）：覆盖下载响应的 Content-Type。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:379
msgid ""
"`response_content_disposition` (string, optional): Overrides the download "
"response's Content-Disposition, for example `attachment; filename="
"\"report.pdf\"`."
msgstr "`response_content_disposition`（string，选填）：覆盖下载响应的 Content-Disposition，例如 `attachment; filename=\"report.pdf\"`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:380
msgid "`version_id` (string, optional): Downloads this object version."
msgstr "`version_id`（string，选填）：下载此对象版本。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:382
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:382"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:384
msgid "Leading `/` is ignored, and the connection's `root` prefix is applied."
msgstr "忽略开头的 `/`，并应用连接的 `root` 前缀。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:385
msgid ""
"Signing is local: it does not download the object or check its existence or "
"access permissions."
msgstr "签名在本地生成：不会下载对象，也不会检查对象是否存在或访问权限。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:386
msgid ""
"Both `access_key_id` and `secret_access_key` are required, including when "
"`allow_anonymous` is enabled. Connection environment fallback and "
"`session_token` are supported."
msgstr "必须同时提供 `access_key_id` 和 `secret_access_key`，即使启用了 `allow_anonymous`。支持连接的环境变量回退和 `session_token`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:387
msgid ""
"The URL may expire earlier if the signing credentials expire or access is "
"revoked. Anyone holding the URL can use it while it remains valid."
msgstr "如果签名凭证过期或访问权限被撤销，URL 可能提前失效。在 URL 有效期间，任何持有者都可以使用它。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:388
msgid ""
"Optional strings must be non-empty. Unknown options and invalid expiration "
"values are rejected."
msgstr "可选字符串不得为空。未知选项和无效的有效期值会被拒绝。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/s3.md:389
msgid ""
"The URL uses the configured endpoint, which must be reachable by the "
"downloader. Response overrides depend on the S3-compatible provider's "
"support."
msgstr "URL 使用配置的 endpoint，下载者必须能够访问该地址。响应覆盖选项取决于 S3 兼容服务提供商的支持。"

